.TH SDL_GetKeyboardFocus 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetKeyboardFocus \- Query the window which currently has keyboard focus.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_keyboard.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_Window * SDL_GetKeyboardFocus(void);
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the window with keyboard focus\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
This function should only be called on the main thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

